    "provider": "ICAS",
    "q": "<img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-apq-m4-015-q-1.png\" alt=\"Question 15\n\nShare-based payments - Victory Rose plc\n\nYou are the recently appointed finance manager of Victory Rose plc (Victory), which prepares its\nfinancial statements to 30 September each year, in accordance with IFRS Accounting Standards.\n\nToday, you are required to account for the outstanding matters relating to share-based payments in the\nAppendix.\n\nRequired:\n\nPrepare, showing all workings, any journal entries necessary to account for the outstanding matters in\nthe Appendix for the year ended 30 September 20X8.\n\n                                                                                    (12 marks)\">",
    "a": "<img class=\"source-facsimile\" src=\"assets/arp-apq-m4-015-a-1.png\" alt=\"Question 15: Solution\n\nVictory Rose plc\n\nShare options (equity-settled)\n\nAdjustment to other reserves\n\nAverage growth rate of new customers = 1/3 years x (9% + 9% + 5%) = 7.7% (&lt;8%)\n\n                                                                                   £’000\nReserve in relation to share options at 30 September 20X7                              750\nRequired reserve at 30 September 20X8 (4 directors x 15,000 options x £9                 540\nAdjustment required                                                                       (210)\n\n                                                                                             (1 mark)\n\n                                                         20X8 calculation (1 mark)\n\n                                                         Adjustment required (1 mark)\n\n                                                                             £’000     £’000\nDr  Retained earnings                                                     210\n    Cr  SPL – staff costs                                                           210\nBeing correction to reserve in relation to share options, prior to exercise\n\n                                                                                             (1 mark)\n\nExercise of options\n\n                                                                                       £’000\nShare capital (3 directors x 15,000 shares x £0.50)                                         23\nShare premium (3 directors x 15,000 shares x £34.50)                                       1,552\nProceeds from issue of share capital                                                    1,575\n                                                                                           (1 mark)\n                                                                              £’000     £’000\nDr  SPL – other operating income                                               1,575\n    Cr   Share capital                                                              23\n    Cr   Share premium                                                                 1,552\nBeing correction to issue of shares under option\n\n                                                                                            (2 marks)\n\nShare appreciation rights\n\nYear ended       Calculation                                         Expense Liability\n30 September 20X7 (1,420 - 296) employees x 50 SAR x £3.50 x 1/3 years               66      66\n30 September 20X8 ([1,420 - 311] employees x 50 SAR x £3.80 x 2/3 years) - £66,000      74     140\n\n                                                                                            (4 marks)\n\n                                                                             £’000     £’000\nDr  SPL – staff costs                                                       74\n    Cr   Other payables                                                             74\nBeing cost of share appreciation rights for the year ended 30 September 20X8\n\n                                                                                             (1 mark)\n\n                                                                           Total marks (12 marks)\n\n\n\n                                                                               25\">",
    "isHTML": true,
    "linkTags": [
      "cash-settled-share-based-payments"
    ],
